---
title: Leaving — Reporter Goes Quiet, Chat Becomes Reports
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: 14px
---

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor reporter as Reporter
    participant line as LINE
    participant webhook as App: webhook<br/>controllers/line.py
    participant sweeper as App: sweeper<br/>workers/sweeper.py
    participant worker as App: worker<br/>workers/worker.py
    participant redis as Redis
    participant postgres as PostgreSQL
    participant gemini as Gemini

    %% 1. Reporter leaves
    rect rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15)
        Note over reporter: stops sending messages
        opt reporter blocks the bot
            reporter ->> line: block
            line ->> webhook: unfollow event
            webhook ->> postgres: users.blocked_at = now<br/>no more broadcast messages
            webhook -->> line: 200 OK
            Note over webhook,postgres: the open session closes the same way
        end
    end

    %% 2. Sweeper closes the silent session
    rect rgba(255, 190, 110, 0.12)
        loop every SWEEP_EVERY_SECONDS 60
            sweeper ->> postgres: find open sessions silent over CLOSE_AFTER_MINUTES 120<br/>broadcast with no reply: BROADCAST_WAIT_HOURS 24
            sweeper ->> redis: IDLE to CLOSING
            Note over sweeper: not IDLE, chatting or SUSPENDED: skip this session
            sweeper ->> postgres: session to closed, only if still silent
            alt closed
                sweeper ->> redis: delete all keys of the session
                sweeper ->> redis: push analyse job
            else a message came in while closing
                sweeper ->> redis: CLOSING to IDLE
                opt buffer has messages
                    sweeper ->> redis: IDLE to BUFFERING, push chat job
                end
                Note over sweeper,redis: chat goes on: sequence-normal.mmd
            end
        end
    end

    %% 3. Worker turns the chat into reports
    rect rgba(120, 220, 160, 0.12)
        worker ->> redis: pop analyse job
        worker ->> postgres: read transcript, without skipped messages
        alt reporter wrote nothing, a broadcast with no reply
            worker ->> postgres: session to analysed, no Gemini call
        else reporter wrote something
            worker ->> postgres: read active ai_config, analyser prompt and model
            worker ->> gemini: analyser prompt + transcript<br/>photos and pins labelled photo n, location n
            gemini -->> worker: 0 to n reports JSON
            worker ->> postgres: save ai_call
            worker ->> postgres: save reports, lat/lng from location n<br/>link photo n to its report
            worker ->> postgres: session to analysed
        end
        Note over worker,postgres: reports show in GET /api/dashboard/reports<br/>the next message from the reporter opens a new session
    end

    %% broken analyser JSON: sequence-fallback.mmd
